  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 12.4.1\n\n### Fixes\n- A paragraph whose text starts at the same offset as an empty inline (an empty `RichSpan`, or the `MarkdownHtmlInline` marker a markdown `<span>` tag leaves) paints its text. The text source could stop at the empty inline, read it as the end of the paragraph, and lay out nothing, so a markdown paragraph of `<span>` lines joined by hard breaks showed blank while its text was still in the document.\n- `DocumentSnapshotBuilder.EndContainer` ends a table started inside the container, so the table is part of the container. A table row or cell added with no table open starts a table implicitly, and when the caller never ended it the table stayed open past the container, collected later rows, and was added to the document root at `Build`.",
